   "id": "e10",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      66.0,
      636.0,
      300.48,
      644.64
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Ulyssis\u2019 is a compact, small to medium sized plant with light"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      65.04,
      647.04,
      300.24,
      655.44
     ],
     "text": "green leaves and a profusion of yellow flowers. The influores-"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      65.04,
      657.84,
      300.0,
      666.72
     ],
     "text": "cences are larger than those of \u201cCalifornia Gold\u2019 and are dis-"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      65.04,
      668.88,
      273.12,
      675.84
     ],
     "text": "tinct from the cream-coloured flowers of \u201cCream Star\u2019."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "score": 0.9245,
   "signal": "pp-doclayoutv3",
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "\u2018Ulyssis\u2019 is a compact, small to medium sized plant with light\ngreen leaves and a profusion of yellow flowers. The influores-\ncences are larger than those of \u201cCalifornia Gold\u2019 and are dis-\ntinct from the cream-coloured flowers of \u201cCream Star\u2019.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    64.8,
    685.68,
    300.48,
    768.48
   ],
   "confidence": null,
   "id": "e11",
   "lines": [
    {
     "bbox": [
      65.76,
      685.68,
      300.24,
      694.56
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Ulyssis\u2019 has medium leat serration. while this is fine in"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      65.76,
      696.72,
      300.24,
      705.36
     ],
     "text": "\u2018California Gold*. The long axes of ray florets are straight in"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      66.0,
      707.76,
      300.48,
      716.4
     ],
     "text": "\u2018Ulyssis\u2019 and reflexing in \u201cCalifornia Gold\u2019. \"Ulyssis\u201d has"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      65.04,
      718.56,
      300.0,
      727.2
     ],
     "text": "shorter peduncles than either of the two comparative varieties."
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      64.8,
      729.36,
      300.24,
      737.76
     ],
     "text": "The faded flowers of \u2018Ulyssis\u2019 are lighter coloured than are"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      64.8,
      740.16,
      300.24,
      746.88
     ],
     "text": "those of \u2018California Gold\u2019. Dise colour before anther dehis-"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      64.8,
      750.72,
      299.76,
      759.12
     ],
     "text": "cence corresponds to RHS 14A in \u2018Ulyssis* and \u201cCream Star\u2019"
    },
    {
     "bbox": [
      64.8,
      761.76,
      207.36,
      768.48
     ],
     "text": "and to RHS 17A in \u2018California Gold\u2019."
    }
   ],
   "page": 1,
   "score": 0.9448,
   "signal": "pp-doclayoutv3",
   "source": "tesseract-psm3",
   "text": "\u2018Ulyssis\u2019 has medium leat serration. while this is fine in\n\u2018California Gold*. The long axes of ray florets are straight in\n\u2018Ulyssis\u2019 and reflexing in \u201cCalifornia Gold\u2019. \"Ulyssis\u201d has\nshorter peduncles than either of the two comparative varieties.\nThe faded flowers of \u2018Ulyssis\u2019 are lighter coloured than are\nthose of \u2018California Gold\u2019. Dise colour before anther dehis-\ncence corresponds to RHS 14A in \u2018Ulyssis* and \u201cCream Star\u2019\nand to RHS 17A in \u2018California Gold\u2019.",
   "text_format": "plain",
   "type": "text"
  },
